# ---- odd meters (hand written, tools/write_meter_grooves.py) ----
# The step counts divide the bar: 7/8 takes 7, 14, 21 ... steps; spaces are only for reading.
# Jazz /4 meters count triplets (3 steps per quarter), the others eighths.

[house verse 7/8 intensity=0.20-0.80]
K     x.. .x .x
S     ... x. x.
H     xxx xx xx

[techno verse 5/4 intensity=0.20-0.80]
K     x. x. x. x. x.
RS    .. .. .. x. ..
H     .x .x .x .x .x
